        "title": "LEX & PARTNERS LAW FIRM",
        "meta_descr": "Welcome to Lex & Partners, a full-service law firm based in Kuala Lumpur. We are dedicated to delivering clear, practical, and result-driven legal solutions to individuals, corporations, and institutions.",
        "header_custom": "",
